@startuml
[*] --> Idle :
Idle --> Inserted : Card insertion
Inserted --> Greeted : User arrival (greeting)
Greeted --> PinChecked : PIN entered
PinChecked --> OptionsAvailable : PIN correct
PinChecked --> KeepCard : PIN incorrect, multiple attempts
OptionsAvailable --> RequestProcessed : User selects an option
RequestProcessed --> Idle : Operation completed or canceled

KeepCard --> Idle : Card kept for security
RequestProcessed --> [*] : Final state reached

@enduml
